{
  "name": "library-folders-remove",
  "description": "The page reads the registry of two projects whose first folder does not exist, asks the host for both folders, and removes the first project: the host answers the removal question and the release, removes the project from the registry, answers the registry without it, and receives the surfaces that remain; the library asks for the remaining folder again. The operation event of the removal is counted by the gate and leaves as one count in a log batch.",
